# Regenerable, and large. Nothing here is a result -- results/ holds the JSON
# the tables are built from, and it is small enough to keep. Same policy as
# phase1_matmul/.gitignore.
#
#   inputs/     saved operand tensors. `common2.fused_inputs`/`sdpa_inputs`
#               regenerate them bit-identically from a fixed seed, so committing
#               them buys nothing the seed does not already guarantee.
#   artifacts/  PTX/SASS/cubin dumps and the raw ncu CSVs. The *census* of these
#               (results/ncu_fused.json, results/ncu_sdpa.json) is what the
#               report reads; the dumps are for looking at by hand.

inputs/
artifacts/
.torch_ext/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
